{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"user interface evaluation user interface evaluation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","fileName":"User Interface Evaluation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"User Interface Evaluation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[UX Evaluation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Cognitive Walkthrough","Heuristic Evaluation","Formative Evaluation","Summative Evaluation","Usability","Presence","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"user interface evaluation user interface evaluation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","fileName":"User Interface Evaluation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"User Interface Evaluation","heading":"User Interface Evaluation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"User interface evaluation is the analysis, assessment, and testing of a whole interface or one of its components. Its main purpose is to find usability problems so the design can be revised iteratively.\n\nAn evaluation method is a particular procedure, such as a [[Cognitive Walkthrough]], [[Heuristic Evaluation]], [[Formative Evaluation]], or [[Summative Evaluation]]. An evaluation approach combines methods in a sequence suited to a project.\n\nUseful evidence includes system performance, user task performance, and subjective response. Speed and accuracy alone do not equal [[Usability]]; learning, comfort, [[Presence]], and other aspects of [[User Experience]] may also matter.","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Cognitive Walkthrough","Heuristic Evaluation","Formative Evaluation","Summative Evaluation","Usability","Presence","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"user interface evaluation user interface evaluation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/User Interface Evaluation.md","fileName":"User Interface Evaluation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"User Interface Evaluation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Cognitive Walkthrough","Heuristic Evaluation","Formative Evaluation","Summative Evaluation","Usability","Presence","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}